{"case": {"kind": "debunk", "question": "☀️ 太阳是黄色的?", "expected_verdict": "fake", "expected_type": "debunk", "item_id": 11}, "result": {"route": "knowledge", "intent": "explain", "evidence_source": "local", "verdict": null, "answer": "太阳其实是白色的!太阳发出的光包含所有可见光波长,混合后呈白色。我们在地球上看到太阳偏黄,是因为大气层散射了部分蓝光,让太阳显得偏黄或橙。在太空中看太阳,或在正午太阳高度角大时,太阳更接近白色。", "truth": "太阳本质上是白色的,我们看到的黄色是大气层散射造成的视觉效果。", "origin": "", "origin_provenance": "none", "why": "", "source": "天体物理学 · 光学原理", "confidence": "high", "confidence_label": "🟢 确证 · 直接命中且有权威来源", "related": ["🌙 月球背面永远是黑暗的?", "🪐 土星能浮在水上?", "🌍 地球是完美的球体?"], "materials_hit": 1, "materials_candidates": 1, "refused": false, "evidence_chain": [{"title": "☀️ 太阳是黄色的?", "source": "天体物理学 · 光学原理", "type": "debunk", "url": "", "snippet": "太阳本质上是白色的,我们看到的黄色是大气层散射造成的视觉效果。", "verdict": "fake", "score": 14}], "verification": {"support_ratio": 1.0, "claims": [], "unsupported_claims": [], "consistent": true, "reason": "mock/启发式校验：按回答与证据的 bigram 覆盖率估算", "mode": "heuristic"}, "agent_trace": [{"agent": "IntentAgent", "ms": 0.1}, {"agent": "RetrievalAgent", "ms": 22.7}, {"agent": "ReviewAgent", "ms": 0.0}, {"agent": "SciencePopAgent", "ms": 0.0}, {"agent": "ExtensionAgent", "ms": 0.0}, {"agent": "GroundingVerifier", "ms": 0.1}]}, "score": {"passed": true, "refusal_correct": null, "source_ok": true, "grounded": true, "citation_ok": true, "verdict_ok": false, "support_ratio": 1.0}}
{"case": {"kind": "debunk", "question": "📱 手机信号会干扰飞机导航?", "expected_verdict": "partial", "expected_type": "debunk", "item_id": 55}, "result": {"route": "knowledge", "intent": "explain", "evidence_source": "local", "verdict": null, "answer": "风险极小但规定合理。现代飞机设计有强大的抗干扰能力,手机信号实际干扰飞行系统的案例极罕见。但在理论上,大量同时使用的手机可能产生微弱干扰。限制更多是出于谨慎原则和地面网络管理。", "truth": "手机对现代飞机的实际干扰极小,限制更多基于谨慎原则。", "origin": "", "origin_provenance": "none", "why": "", "source": "航空电子学 · FAA研究", "confidence": "high", "confidence_label": "🟢 确证 · 直接命中且有权威来源", "related": ["🚀 在太空中人会瞬间爆炸?", "🧲 磁铁会破坏手机和电脑?"], "materials_hit": 1, "materials_candidates": 1, "refused": false, "evidence_chain": [{"title": "📱 手机信号会干扰飞机导航?", "source": "航空电子学 · FAA研究", "type": "debunk", "url": "", "snippet": "手机对现代飞机的实际干扰极小,限制更多基于谨慎原则。", "verdict": "partial", "score": 40}], "verification": {"support_ratio": 1.0, "claims": [], "unsupported_claims": [], "consistent": true, "reason": "mock/启发式校验：按回答与证据的 bigram 覆盖率估算", "mode": "heuristic"}, "agent_trace": [{"agent": "IntentAgent", "ms": 0.1}, {"agent": "RetrievalAgent", "ms": 20.8}, {"agent": "ReviewAgent", "ms": 0.0}, {"agent": "SciencePopAgent", "ms": 0.0}, {"agent": "ExtensionAgent", "ms": 0.0}, {"agent": "GroundingVerifier", "ms": 0.1}]}, "score": {"passed": true, "refusal_correct": null, "source_ok": true, "grounded": true, "citation_ok": true, "verdict_ok": false, "support_ratio": 1.0}}
{"case": {"kind": "knowledge", "question": "🐙 海星把胃翻出体外来消化食物？", "expected_verdict": null, "expected_type": "knowledge", "item_id": 1010}, "result": {"route": "knowledge", "intent": "explain", "evidence_source": "local", "verdict": null, "answer": "许多海星拥有独特的体外消化方式。当遇到贝类等猎物时，它们用管足撬开一条缝隙，然后把自己的贲门胃从口中翻出体外，直接伸进贝壳缝里，分泌消化酶把猎物在原地液化，再把营养和胃一起吸收回体内。这种方式让海星能吃下比自己嘴大得多的食物。海星没有大脑和血液，靠一套水管系统驱动无数管足移动和捕食，是棘皮动物中构造极为特别的一类。", "truth": "海星能把胃翻出体外，在猎物身上直接消化。", "origin": "", "origin_provenance": "none", "why": "", "source": "海洋生物学·棘皮动物研究", "confidence": "high", "confidence_label": "🟢 确证 · 直接命中且有权威来源", "related": [], "materials_hit": 1, "materials_candidates": 1, "refused": false, "evidence_chain": [{"title": "🐙 海星把胃翻出体外来消化食物", "source": "海洋生物学·棘皮动物研究", "type": "knowledge", "url": "", "snippet": "海星能把胃翻出体外，在猎物身上直接消化。", "verdict": "true", "score": 47}], "verification": {"support_ratio": 1.0, "claims": [], "unsupported_claims": [], "consistent": true, "reason": "mock/启发式校验：按回答与证据的 bigram 覆盖率估算", "mode": "heuristic"}, "agent_trace": [{"agent": "IntentAgent", "ms": 0.0}, {"agent": "RetrievalAgent", "ms": 21.0}, {"agent": "ReviewAgent", "ms": 0.0}, {"agent": "SciencePopAgent", "ms": 0.0}, {"agent": "ExtensionAgent", "ms": 0.0}, {"agent": "GroundingVerifier", "ms": 0.1}]}, "score": {"passed": true, "refusal_correct": null, "source_ok": true, "grounded": true, "citation_ok": true, "verdict_ok": null, "support_ratio": 1.0}}
{"case": {"kind": "knowledge", "question": "🐡 河豚的毒素比氰化物强上千倍？", "expected_verdict": null, "expected_type": "knowledge", "item_id": 1005}, "result": {"route": "knowledge", "intent": "explain", "evidence_source": "local", "verdict": null, "answer": "河豚体内含有河豚毒素，这是一种极强的神经毒素，按重量计其毒性约为氰化物的1000倍以上。它通过阻断神经细胞的钠离子通道让肌肉和呼吸系统瘫痪，目前没有特效解毒剂。一条河豚所含的毒素理论上足以致死数十人。有趣的是，河豚自身并不制造这种毒素，而是通过摄食含有特定细菌的食物在体内累积，人工养殖并控制食物的河豚可以做到几乎无毒。", "truth": "河豚毒素是极强的神经毒素，毒性远超氰化物。", "origin": "", "origin_provenance": "none", "why": "", "source": "海洋生物学·毒理学研究", "confidence": "high", "confidence_label": "🟢 确证 · 直接命中且有权威来源", "related": [], "materials_hit": 1, "materials_candidates": 1, "refused": false, "evidence_chain": [{"title": "🐡 河豚的毒素比氰化物强上千倍", "source": "海洋生物学·毒理学研究", "type": "knowledge", "url": "", "snippet": "河豚毒素是极强的神经毒素，毒性远超氰化物。", "verdict": "true", "score": 38}], "verification": {"support_ratio": 1.0, "claims": [], "unsupported_claims": [], "consistent": true, "reason": "mock/启发式校验：按回答与证据的 bigram 覆盖率估算", "mode": "heuristic"}, "agent_trace": [{"agent": "IntentAgent", "ms": 0.0}, {"agent": "RetrievalAgent", "ms": 21.2}, {"agent": "ReviewAgent", "ms": 0.0}, {"agent": "SciencePopAgent", "ms": 0.0}, {"agent": "ExtensionAgent", "ms": 0.0}, {"agent": "GroundingVerifier", "ms": 0.1}]}, "score": {"passed": true, "refusal_correct": null, "source_ok": true, "grounded": true, "citation_ok": true, "verdict_ok": null, "support_ratio": 1.0}}
{"case": {"kind": "knowledge", "question": "🦟 蚊子每秒振翅800次？", "expected_verdict": null, "expected_type": "knowledge", "item_id": 407}, "result": {"route": "knowledge", "intent": "explain", "evidence_source": "local", "verdict": null, "answer": "蚊子翅膀振动频率达到每秒300-800次,这也是蚊子'嗡嗡'声的来源。雌蚊和雄蚊能通过翅膀振动频率识别彼此,求偶时会调整频率达到和谐共振。这个振动频率远超人类能看清的速度,这就是为什么蚊子翅膀看起来是模糊的。", "truth": "蚊子翅膀振动频率确实达到每秒数百次,产生特有的嗡嗡声。", "origin": "", "origin_provenance": "none", "why": "", "source": "昆虫学 · 蚊子行为研究", "confidence": "high", "confidence_label": "🟢 确证 · 直接命中且有权威来源", "related": ["🐝 工蜂全是母的,雄蜂只负责交配然后死", "🦎 壁虎脚上有数百万根纳米纤毛", "🐝 蜜蜂跳舞来传递方向信息"], "materials_hit": 1, "materials_candidates": 1, "refused": false, "evidence_chain": [{"title": "🦟 蚊子每秒振翅800次", "source": "昆虫学 · 蚊子行为研究", "type": "knowledge", "url": "", "snippet": "蚊子翅膀振动频率确实达到每秒数百次,产生特有的嗡嗡声。", "verdict": "true", "score": 40}], "verification": {"support_ratio": 1.0, "claims": [], "unsupported_claims": [], "consistent": true, "reason": "mock/启发式校验：按回答与证据的 bigram 覆盖率估算", "mode": "heuristic"}, "agent_trace": [{"agent": "IntentAgent", "ms": 0.0}, {"agent": "RetrievalAgent", "ms": 20.9}, {"agent": "ReviewAgent", "ms": 0.0}, {"agent": "SciencePopAgent", "ms": 0.0}, {"agent": "ExtensionAgent", "ms": 0.0}, {"agent": "GroundingVerifier", "ms": 0.1}]}, "score": {"passed": true, "refusal_correct": null, "source_ok": true, "grounded": true, "citation_ok": true, "verdict_ok": null, "support_ratio": 1.0}}
